{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26635","headline":"冬夜书事寄两省阁老 · 姚合","name":"冬夜书事寄两省阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天寒渐觉雁声疎，新月微微玉漏初。\n海峤只宜今日去，故乡已过十年余。\n发稀岂易胜玄冕，眼暗应难写谏书。\n阁下羣公尽高思，谁能携酒访贫居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}